<template><view class="page"><AppHeader/><view class="content"><view class="hero"><view class="hero-copy"><view class="display">看见你，<br/>也理解适合你的方式。</view><view class="lead">从五官特征、身材比例、色彩气质、材质偏好，<br class="desktop"/>到真实生活场景与个人风格，<br class="desktop"/>为你制定专属的形象提升方案。</view><view class="editorial-btn cta" @click="start">开始形象咨询　→</view><text class="motto">更清晰的你　/　更自在的生活</text></view><view class="hero-visual"><image class="image-monochrome" src="/static/design/hero-balanced.png" mode="aspectFill"/></view></view><view class="domains"><view class="domain-head"><view><view class="section-title">专业的形象咨询，从整体开始</view><view class="lead">不止于单一改变，而是基于整体的风格塑造</view></view><text>A HOLISTIC APPROACH TO YOUR IMAGE</text></view><view class="domain-layout"><view class="domain-grid"><view v-for="(m,key,i) in advisorModules" :key="key" class="domain" @click="open(key)"><image class="image-monochrome" :src="images[key]" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="domain-shade"></view><text class="domain-num">0{{i+1}}</text><view class="domain-copy"><text class="domain-name">{{m.name}}</text><small>{{m.desc}}</small></view><text class="domain-arrow">→</text></view></view><view class="home-profile" @click="profile"><image class="profile-portrait image-monochrome" src="/static/design/consultation-side-balanced.png" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="profile-summary"><text v-if="currentUser" class="profile-name">{{currentUser.nickname}}</text><text v-else class="profile-name">你的形象档案</text><small>{{currentUser?'更清晰的自己，正在逐渐展开':'登录后沉淀你的专属形象记录'}}</small><view class="profile-swatches"><image src="/static/design/fabric-texture.webp"/><image src="/static/design/black-texture.webp"/><image src="/static/design/wine-texture.webp"/></view></view><text class="profile-quote">“ 真正的风格，是让你感到自在的选择。”</text></view></view></view></view></view></template>
<script setup lang="ts">import{currentUser,isLoggedIn,openLogin}from'../../auth';import{draft,modules}from'../../state';const{tryon,...advisorModules}=modules;void tryon;const images:{[k:string]:string}={hair:'/static/design/home-card-hair-balanced.png',skin:'/static/design/home-card-skin-balanced.png',outfit:'/static/design/home-card-outfit-balanced.png',makeup:'/static/design/home-card-makeup-balanced.png'};function start(){isLoggedIn()?uni.navigateTo({url:'/pages/modules/index'}):openLogin('modules')}function open(key:string){if(!isLoggedIn()){openLogin('modules');return}draft.module=key;uni.navigateTo({url:`/pages/preferences/index?module=${key}`})}function profile(){currentUser.value?uni.switchTab({url:'/pages/profile/index'}):openLogin('profile')}</script>
<style scoped>.hero{display:grid;margin-top:42px}.hero-copy{padding:28px 0}.cta{width:255px;margin-top:34px}.motto{display:block;margin-top:38px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px}.hero-visual{position:relative;min-height:390px;overflow:hidden}.hero-visual image{width:100%;height:100%;filter:grayscale(1)}.domains{margin-top:45px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:30px}.domain-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end}.domain-head>text{display:none;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:5px}.domain-layout{display:grid;gap:26px;margin-top:20px}.domain-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3px}.domain,.home-profile{height:230px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.domain{color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .36s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1),box-shadow .36s ease}.domain image,.domain-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.domain image{transform:scale(1.01);transition:transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1),filter .4s ease}.domain-shade{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,12,16,.04) 36%,rgba(10,12,16,.78) 100%);transition:background .38s ease}.domain-num,.domain-copy,.domain-arrow{position:absolute;z-index:1;transition:transform .36s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1),color .3s ease}.domain-num{top:14px;left:14px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:34px;font-style:italic;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86)}.domain-copy{left:15px;right:15px;bottom:16px}.domain-name,.domain-copy small{display:block}.domain-name{font-family:"Songti SC",serif;font-size:20px}.domain-copy small{margin-top:5px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}.domain-arrow{right:14px;bottom:14px;font-size:17px}.home-profile{display:none;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#e4e7eb);cursor:pointer}.profile-portrait{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:42%;height:72%;filter:grayscale(1)}.profile-summary{position:absolute;left:46%;right:5%;top:10%}.profile-name,.profile-summary small{display:block}.profile-name{font-family:"Songti SC",serif;font-size:17px}.profile-summary small{margin-top:7px;color:#727780;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}.profile-swatches{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:14px}.profile-swatches image{width:34px;height:34px}.profile-quote{position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:8%;font-family:"Songti SC",serif;font-size:11px}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.domain:hover{z-index:2;transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(20,23,28,.22)}.domain:hover image{transform:scale(1.075);filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.06)}.domain:hover .domain-shade{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(10,12,16,.01) 25%,rgba(10,12,16,.88) 100%)}.domain:hover .domain-num{transform:translate(3px,2px)}.domain:hover .domain-copy{transform:translateY(-4px)}.domain:hover .domain-arrow{transform:translateX(5px)}}.domain:active{transform:scale(.985)}@media(min-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:40% 60%;min-height:480px}.hero-copy{padding:58px 18px 0 0}.hero-visual{min-height:480px}.domain-head>text{display:block}.domain-layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,3fr) minmax(280px,1fr)}.domain-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.domain,.home-profile{height:255px}.home-profile{display:block}.display{font-size:55px}}</style>
